		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Utility Goggles</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — Tactical goggles that grant advantage and darkvision.</em></p><p><strong>Free Action.</strong> Gain advantage on your next roll.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Your next roll is considered 2 higher. A roll over a die's maximum is a crit.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You can see in the dark.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[M] Add 2 to your next roll; if that exceeds the die maximum, treat it as a crit.</em></p>",
